{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Rabbit's Foot is an animal product obtained from a ",["l","兔子","Rabbit"]," with sufficient ",["l","动物","friendship"],", ",["l","动物","mood"],", and ",["l","运气","daily luck"],". It can also occasionally be purchased from the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," for 1,695–2,825g or dropped by ",["l","飞蛇","Serpent"],"s in the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"]," (0.8% chance). One may be purchased from ",["l","贾斯","Jas"]," in her ",["l","沙漠节","shop"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," for 100 Calico Eggs ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"],"s. It can also be gifted by a ",["l","动物","pet"]," cat with max ",["l","动物","friendship"],"."]],["p",[["l","运气","Luck buffs"]," do not influence the chances of getting a Rabbit's Foot. Despite the description, carrying a Rabbit's Foot does not increase the player's luck."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Love"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","潘妮","Penny"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Rabbit's Foot is used in the Bulletin Board."]]]],["Recipes",2,[["p",["Rabbit's Foot is not used in any recipes."]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Rabbit's Foot is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号","Sewing Machine"]," to create 